<title>UK: Russia's Unexim prices $200 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Russia's Unexim prices $200 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and International Co for Finance and Investment (ICFI) has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNEXIM INTERNATIONAL FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JOINT STOCK CO (UNITED EXPORT/IMPORT BANK)</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     9.875     MATURITY    01.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.81     PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.81     SPREAD	+400 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> IBCA	 BB	  DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/RU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (1)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.25</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
